        {
          "id": "subtitle",
          "type": "text",
          "enabled": true,
          "order": 2,
          "props": {
            "text": "rolldown is a Rust-native bundler with a TypeScript-first plugin API. It reads your tsconfig, infers your entrypoints, and ships an optimized bundle in under 800ms on a mid-range laptop. No webpack.config.js. No vite.config.ts unless you want one. Drop-in replacement for esbuild on 92% of public benchmarks."
